WEBVTT

01:27.785 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL MY QUEEN
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:37.625 --> 01:41.105
The best effect of birth-control tea
lasts only three days.

01:45.585 --> 01:48.425
So this is what you call keeping me safe?

01:52.825 --> 01:53.705
Yes.

02:08.545 --> 02:09.545
Well.

02:15.865 --> 02:17.345
Then it must be to go along

02:18.985 --> 02:20.625
with His Majesty's wishes.

03:40.905 --> 03:41.825
Why?

03:45.185 --> 03:46.465
If you truly wish to ask me,

03:47.825 --> 03:48.985
then I shall tell you.

03:52.305 --> 03:53.385
I cannot have

03:54.065 --> 03:55.665
a child of the Ling bloodline.

04:01.425 --> 04:02.305
Liar.

04:11.345 --> 04:12.185
Liar!

04:16.025 --> 04:19.184
Which words of yours are true,
and which are false?

04:29.185 --> 04:31.545
You push me away ten paces,

04:31.625 --> 04:33.065
then pull me back again.

04:35.025 --> 04:36.665
Do you truly find this amusing?

05:10.945 --> 05:14.345
WUYING HALL

05:27.985 --> 05:29.025
Your Majesty.

05:30.945 --> 05:31.785
You may return.

05:32.665 --> 05:34.825
There is no need to administer
the needles today.

05:38.945 --> 05:41.465
Why does Your Majesty
not tell Her Majesty the truth?

05:42.105 --> 05:43.345
Why not tell her

05:43.425 --> 05:44.985
what manner of cruel man her father is?

05:48.225 --> 05:50.705
Ling Xuefeng has always showered
her with affection.

05:51.265 --> 05:53.545
How could she possibly accept
such a truth?

05:53.625 --> 05:54.825
Must all of this

05:55.345 --> 05:56.865
fall upon Your Majesty alone?

05:59.545 --> 06:00.385
I am used to it.

06:02.665 --> 06:05.065
Your Majesty has grown used to
Her Majesty's many misunderstandings.

06:05.665 --> 06:06.945
So used, even,

06:07.505 --> 06:08.785
that you would give up
the life-saving cure.

06:10.985 --> 06:13.385
Is this the sincerity
Your Majesty speaks of?

06:13.465 --> 06:15.105
Regarding the Frost Reed,

06:15.625 --> 06:17.545
I hope the Imperial Preceptor
will never mention it again,

06:18.905 --> 06:20.225
especially before the Empress.

06:20.825 --> 06:23.705
If I discover that you defy my will,

06:24.345 --> 06:26.305
do not blame me for showing no mercy.

06:37.105 --> 06:39.265
Yes, Your Majesty.

07:06.425 --> 07:09.145
Your Majesty. Song Lanxi,
the lady-in-waiting, seeks an audience.

07:10.105 --> 07:11.145
Sect Leader.

07:12.305 --> 07:13.145
It is me.

07:22.865 --> 07:24.145
Zhong Lin.

07:25.305 --> 07:26.625
This… What has happened?

07:27.705 --> 07:29.385
It truly is you.

07:48.265 --> 07:50.345
So much has happened in so little time.

07:50.985 --> 07:53.465
I told you that Bai fellow,
he was never anything good.

07:56.025 --> 07:58.465
Cangcang.
Why don't we return to Southern Chu?

07:58.545 --> 08:00.025
We can restore Fenglai Pavilion.

08:01.265 --> 08:02.665
Restore Fenglai Pavilion…

08:06.345 --> 08:08.305
Can I still become
the Ling Cangcang I once was?

08:08.945 --> 08:10.705
Of course you can. Why wouldn't you?

08:11.225 --> 08:12.865
You are the famed heroine
everyone speaks of.

08:22.705 --> 08:25.265
Xiao Qianqing… Would he even let you go?

08:26.545 --> 08:29.145
Why should I care?
He certainly can't stop me.

08:31.985 --> 08:32.865
I cannot leave yet.

08:35.105 --> 08:35.945
There is something I must do.

08:37.105 --> 08:37.945
What is it?

08:42.664 --> 08:44.945
You said His Majesty gave
Her Majesty birth-control tea?

08:45.625 --> 08:46.505
Yes.

08:46.585 --> 08:47.465
Rumors are already spreading
in the palace.

08:47.545 --> 08:48.585
-They say…
-They say what?

08:49.185 --> 08:50.025
They say His Majesty

08:50.105 --> 08:51.345
does not want the Empress
to bear a child of the Ling bloodline.

08:52.825 --> 08:54.785
Xiao Huan is out of his mind.

08:54.865 --> 08:56.945
Father. If this continues,

08:57.025 --> 08:58.465
Cangcang will be doomed sooner or later.

08:59.985 --> 09:01.185
She will not.

09:02.545 --> 09:05.665
A man at death's door
is hardly worth fearing.

09:07.025 --> 09:07.865
Xianxue.

09:08.745 --> 09:10.545
Contact Cangcang at once.

09:11.465 --> 09:13.305
She must be heartbroken right now.

09:14.545 --> 09:16.145
This is our best chance

09:16.825 --> 09:17.785
to obtain the Moon-Eclipse.

09:18.505 --> 09:19.345
Yes, Father.

09:19.425 --> 09:21.025
HANMO

09:21.105 --> 09:22.025
Wait.

09:30.745 --> 09:31.785
Xianxue.

09:35.105 --> 09:37.185
I know you worry for Cangcang.

09:37.265 --> 09:38.905
As her father, so do I.

09:40.625 --> 09:42.985
If you wish to truly protect her,

09:43.705 --> 09:45.505
then you must first

09:46.545 --> 09:47.585
become stronger.

10:07.945 --> 10:08.785
Master.

10:11.545 --> 10:13.185
No…

10:19.465 --> 10:20.625
Your Majesty. What troubles you?

10:20.705 --> 10:22.225
Another nightmare?

10:23.905 --> 10:24.745
It is nothing.

10:25.425 --> 10:27.065
Your Majesty's health
has only just improved.

10:27.145 --> 10:28.345
You are still vulnerable
to outside chills.

10:29.745 --> 10:31.985
You have stayed
inside the palace chambers for days.

10:32.065 --> 10:34.225
You should at least go out
and take in some sunlight.

10:35.585 --> 10:36.425
Well.

10:58.225 --> 11:00.225
WUYING HALL

11:00.305 --> 11:01.425
Your Majesty.

11:01.505 --> 11:02.785
I have already done as ordered

11:02.865 --> 11:04.545
and deliberately leaked
the news to Grand Tutor Ling.

11:07.385 --> 11:09.345
May he restrain himself,

11:09.425 --> 11:10.465
and cease using Cangcang again.

11:11.105 --> 11:12.145
But I have just learned

11:12.225 --> 11:13.665
that Her Majesty has left the palace

11:13.745 --> 11:15.145
and headed toward
the hot-spring palace residence.

11:23.025 --> 11:24.225
Greets Your Majesty.

11:24.905 --> 11:27.545
We greet Your Majesty.

11:37.625 --> 11:44.145
LINGQUAN PALACE

12:13.785 --> 12:15.505
Your Majesty is not in a rush
to depart, right?

12:16.585 --> 12:17.745
If not,

12:17.825 --> 12:21.105
I would like to accompany
Your Majesty in a game of chess.

12:21.185 --> 12:22.025
Would that be agreeable?

12:22.945 --> 12:25.465
My chess skills
were all taught by the Grand Tutor.

12:25.545 --> 12:28.385
Today, Grand Tutor may judge for yourself

12:28.465 --> 12:30.465
whether I have improved.

12:38.305 --> 12:42.305
In recent days, I heard a curious tale.

12:43.465 --> 12:46.265
It is said that the magistrate of Mixian
tried a peculiar case.

12:46.345 --> 12:49.545
Two women, both claiming a single infant.

12:49.625 --> 12:51.985
Each insisting the child was her own.

12:53.065 --> 12:54.025
Your Majesty.

12:54.625 --> 12:57.025
If this case were left to you,

12:57.865 --> 12:58.945
how would you judge it?

12:59.545 --> 13:02.225
Let the two women
each take one of the child's hands.

13:02.945 --> 13:05.585
The infant is frail
and cannot endure such struggle.

13:05.665 --> 13:07.185
To keep the child unharmed,

13:07.705 --> 13:11.105
the one who lets go first
must be the true mother.

13:14.105 --> 13:15.625
Your Majesty is indeed wise.

13:16.785 --> 13:20.065
Victory and defeat lie
between a single thought.

13:22.385 --> 13:24.825
Because she could not bear it,
she chose to let go.

13:26.425 --> 13:28.425
But whether that is victory or defeat,

13:29.465 --> 13:32.905
in truth, it is difficult to say.

13:38.385 --> 13:39.785
Your Majesty grew careless.

13:47.705 --> 13:50.305
Your teachings, I have taken to heart.

13:51.905 --> 13:52.905
I also remember

13:52.985 --> 13:54.305
Grand Tutor once taught me…

13:54.825 --> 13:56.545
Pride must not rise,
the heart must not overflow.

13:57.945 --> 14:00.345
As for where the blossoms fall,
nothing is certain yet.

14:17.345 --> 14:20.865
Your Majesty is indeed
the finest student I have ever taught.

14:21.465 --> 14:24.145
This strike, sharp and decisive,
is fine play.

14:26.305 --> 14:28.025
It is Grand Tutor's teachings
that were fine.

14:28.665 --> 14:30.265
But Grand Tutor need not worry.

14:31.065 --> 14:34.025
In me,
there will never be a woman's softness.

14:46.745 --> 14:47.585
-Hongqing.
-Yes.

14:48.265 --> 14:49.345
Grand Tutor is weary.

14:49.425 --> 14:51.465
Escort him to the side hall
to rest for the night.

14:52.265 --> 14:53.145
Yes, Your Majesty.

15:37.745 --> 15:38.785
Have you decided?

15:39.305 --> 15:40.865
Will you truly retrieve the Moon-Eclipse?

15:45.545 --> 15:46.825
You are right.

15:46.905 --> 15:49.465
Only if the Moon-Eclipse is in my hands
will it be safest.

15:51.065 --> 15:52.505
I must destroy it myself.

15:53.025 --> 15:55.105
Only then can I ensure
it never harms the world again.

16:08.865 --> 16:09.705
Master…

16:10.425 --> 16:12.945
You wished for this as well, did you not?

17:22.505 --> 17:23.345
Cangcang.

17:26.305 --> 17:27.704
Cangcang, are you all right?

17:30.265 --> 17:32.745
We must leave first.
We will destroy the Moon-Eclipse later.

17:34.705 --> 17:35.585
Go.

17:58.625 --> 17:59.465
Your Majesty.

18:00.105 --> 18:01.745
The assassin who threatened the Empress
has been seized.

18:02.265 --> 18:03.945
This was found on his person.

18:11.145 --> 18:13.705
He did not threaten me. I summoned him.

18:14.305 --> 18:17.345
Are you certain
you have not been deceived by this thief?

18:18.225 --> 18:19.465
The one who deceived me…

18:21.225 --> 18:22.065
Was it not you?

18:26.745 --> 18:28.945
Your Majesty speaks the sweetest words,

18:30.505 --> 18:31.865
yet does the things that hurt me most.

18:34.585 --> 18:35.945
I was a fool.

18:37.705 --> 18:39.385
Time and again I let you deceive me,

18:40.945 --> 18:42.025
and still believed you.

18:51.905 --> 18:54.025
Cangcang. I warned you long ago.

18:54.665 --> 18:55.665
You should never trust him.

18:56.545 --> 18:58.385
-Take him away.
-Yes.

19:01.585 --> 19:02.705
I told you the fault is not his.

19:03.505 --> 19:05.985
This matter has nothing to do with him.
The fault lies with me.

19:36.425 --> 19:38.985
The one who deceived me… Was it not you?

19:40.145 --> 19:41.945
Your Majesty speaks the sweetest words,

19:42.785 --> 19:44.385
yet does the things that wound me.

19:45.825 --> 19:46.985
I was a fool.

19:48.545 --> 19:50.225
Time and again I let you deceive me,

19:51.825 --> 19:52.785
and still believed you.

20:39.425 --> 20:40.425
What brings you here?

20:47.025 --> 20:48.385
I heard

20:48.465 --> 20:50.785
one must not drink
while soaking in the hot spring.

20:53.385 --> 20:54.785
If you have something to say,

20:55.585 --> 20:56.705
you may speak plainly.

21:19.865 --> 21:21.385
If one drinks this wine,

21:26.425 --> 21:27.865
it will make one

21:31.265 --> 21:32.625
lose all sense and restraint

21:34.425 --> 21:35.745
and lose all control.

21:42.865 --> 21:44.145
For Luo Xianxue,

21:45.425 --> 21:46.865
you dare tease me?

21:51.585 --> 21:52.745
It is from the heart.

22:05.625 --> 22:06.545
Very well.

22:21.985 --> 22:24.825
Just now,
did you not say it was from the heart?

22:29.065 --> 22:30.065
Let him go.

22:31.865 --> 22:33.185
Let him go?

22:34.345 --> 22:36.505
I wish nothing more than
to have him torn apart.

22:37.105 --> 22:38.665
Yet you ask me to spare him?

22:48.225 --> 22:49.425
Then let me hate you.

23:05.425 --> 23:06.905
For Luo Xianxue,

23:07.425 --> 23:09.465
you truly dare to do anything.

23:10.705 --> 23:11.825
I will not kill you.

23:12.785 --> 23:13.945
After all,

23:14.465 --> 23:17.225
I cannot let the Ling clan
follow me to the grave.

23:49.305 --> 23:52.025
EMPEROR'S SEAL

23:58.145 --> 23:59.585
Peace to the Empress.

24:01.665 --> 24:03.025
-Open the door.
-Yes.

24:10.785 --> 24:11.625
Luo.

24:12.825 --> 24:13.705
Cangcang.

24:14.345 --> 24:15.425
Release him.

24:15.505 --> 24:17.145
Without His Majesty's order, I dare not.

24:19.985 --> 24:20.825
This is His Majesty's order.

24:22.905 --> 24:23.745
Yes.

24:41.785 --> 24:42.625
Cangcang.

24:43.345 --> 24:45.465
Luo, go now. Do not return.

24:45.545 --> 24:46.785
You are not leaving?
Let us leave together.

24:48.225 --> 24:49.585
I cannot leave. Nor can I go.

24:50.865 --> 24:52.985
But you are releasing a major criminal.
He will not spare you easily.

24:53.065 --> 24:56.385
I promised to keep you safe,
so I must do so.

24:57.225 --> 24:58.065
As for me,

24:58.145 --> 24:59.985
you need not worry. I have my own way.

25:01.145 --> 25:02.065
There is no time. Go.

25:13.025 --> 25:16.865
LINGQUAN PALACE

25:23.825 --> 25:24.665
Please punish me, Your Majesty.

25:27.425 --> 25:29.865
Good. Very good.

25:31.225 --> 25:33.145
I defied Your decree.
I ask for punishment.

25:33.745 --> 25:36.305
Empress, you have nothing to explain?

25:36.385 --> 25:37.465
Nothing.

25:41.185 --> 25:42.785
The Empress has failed in virtue.

25:42.865 --> 25:44.065
Return to the palace
and remain confined for three days.

25:44.145 --> 25:46.585
Kneel and copy
the scriptures in repentance.

25:46.665 --> 25:48.745
I accept the decree.
And give thanks for the grace.

25:58.745 --> 26:01.545
Do you think I will spare Luo Xianxue?

28:07.505 --> 28:10.025
XIJIANG

29:13.945 --> 29:15.625
QI

29:38.065 --> 29:39.345
Soldiers, hear my command.

29:39.865 --> 29:41.785
Swear to defend Great Qi with your lives.

29:41.865 --> 29:44.185
Swear to guard the border to the last.

29:46.225 --> 29:48.145
In the ninth year of Yongxi,

29:48.225 --> 29:49.905
Kumor, Prince of Xijiang,

29:49.985 --> 29:51.665
resented the census decree,

29:51.745 --> 29:53.705
and marched to besiege Jiangzhou.

29:54.385 --> 29:56.065
Ling Jueding, Governor of Jiangzhou,

29:56.145 --> 29:57.385
led the troops in defense,

29:57.465 --> 29:58.745
and repelled the foe again and again.

29:59.425 --> 30:01.585
But Kumor's advance was relentless.

30:01.665 --> 30:03.305
Jiangzhou was in peril.

30:05.025 --> 30:06.865
Governor Ling Jueding reports,

30:07.385 --> 30:09.105
Kumor rejects the census decree,

30:10.145 --> 30:12.625
and has surrounded Jiangzhou.
Jiangzhou is in danger.

30:14.025 --> 30:16.385
My ministers, what counsel have you?

30:24.505 --> 30:25.385
Your Majesty.

30:26.185 --> 30:27.985
Kumor harbors ill intent.

30:28.585 --> 30:31.065
Jiangzhou lies barely
a thousand li from the capital.

30:31.145 --> 30:34.545
If left unchecked,
the danger may reach the capital itself.

30:34.625 --> 30:36.425
So I propose

30:36.505 --> 30:39.665
Your Majesty dispatch troops
to aid Jiangzhou.

30:51.825 --> 30:52.665
I disagree.

30:53.665 --> 30:56.985
A report came from Xuzhou yesterday.
The locust plague has not yet passed.

30:57.585 --> 31:00.105
The autumn harvest in Xuzhou
has already suffered greatly.

31:01.985 --> 31:03.305
In my view,

31:03.385 --> 31:06.785
the plague must be
our foremost concern at present.

31:08.345 --> 31:11.265
What has this to do with aiding Jiangzhou?

31:11.865 --> 31:14.745
Before the troops set out,
provisions must be prepared.

31:15.345 --> 31:17.225
I once reviewed the state granaries

31:17.825 --> 31:19.505
with Minister Xing
regarding the disaster relief.

31:20.105 --> 31:22.345
Minister Xing knows this matter best.

31:26.865 --> 31:27.705
Your Majesty,

31:28.505 --> 31:29.585
as for the stored grain,

31:29.665 --> 31:31.145
we have less than
eight hundred thousand shi left.

31:32.025 --> 31:33.465
If we reinforce Jiangzhou,

31:33.545 --> 31:36.225
Xuzhou's relief may have to be delayed.

31:37.505 --> 31:39.345
If Your Majesty sends troops to Jiangzhou,

31:39.425 --> 31:41.305
the capital's guards must be mobilized.

31:42.465 --> 31:44.945
Xuzhou is barely a thousand li away.

31:45.025 --> 31:47.225
If the people there cannot be appeased,

31:47.305 --> 31:48.265
and unrest follows,

31:48.785 --> 31:51.465
the capital will be left vulnerable.

31:53.185 --> 31:54.225
Grand Tutor,

31:54.785 --> 31:55.865
what say you?

32:04.785 --> 32:06.105
In my view,

32:06.185 --> 32:08.065
Your Majesty should send aid,

32:09.345 --> 32:10.505
and reinforce Jiangzhou.

32:12.305 --> 32:13.585
And what of Xuzhou?

32:13.665 --> 32:16.465
Xuzhou holds but disaster victims.

32:16.545 --> 32:17.825
But Jiangzhou

32:18.425 --> 32:19.905
is the land of Great Qi.

32:24.345 --> 32:25.945
General Ling Jueding

32:26.025 --> 32:27.585
won fame from youth,

32:27.665 --> 32:29.305
commanding the entire Western Garrison.

32:30.105 --> 32:31.665
To defend Jiangzhou

32:31.745 --> 32:33.305
is hardly beyond him.

32:33.385 --> 32:36.785
General Ling guards Jiangzhou
for Your Majesty,

32:36.865 --> 32:38.745
loyal and steadfast.

32:45.625 --> 32:46.545
Grand Tutor,

32:47.705 --> 32:48.865
what are you implying?

32:49.825 --> 32:52.945
No one trusts General Ling more than I do.

32:53.545 --> 32:56.785
Else why would the command tally
rest in his hands to this day?

32:57.465 --> 32:58.305
Would you not agree, Grand Tutor?

33:00.225 --> 33:02.705
Indeed, Your Majesty.

33:05.825 --> 33:07.665
Xuzhou is in crisis.

33:07.745 --> 33:09.025
I cannot ignore it.

33:09.625 --> 33:11.745
Yet Jiangzhou must be held.

33:11.825 --> 33:13.065
Otherwise,

33:13.145 --> 33:15.225
even General Ling's life
would not absolve him.

33:23.905 --> 33:26.985
This matter is difficult.
I shall ponder it for two more days.

33:27.785 --> 33:29.945
We await Your Majesty's decree.

33:53.065 --> 33:55.705
The Imperial Preceptor says
Your Majesty is gravely ill and must rest.

33:55.785 --> 33:58.385
-No one may enter.
-Commander Li.

33:58.465 --> 34:00.425
You've no idea how chaotic it is outside.

34:00.505 --> 34:02.145
One group after another
is demanding entry.

34:02.225 --> 34:04.265
I can't hold them off.

34:04.345 --> 34:06.705
They're either imperial kin,
or high ministers of court.

34:06.785 --> 34:09.065
Not a single one I dare offend.

34:09.145 --> 34:11.225
I mustn't offend any of them.

34:11.945 --> 34:13.824
So the one you can offend is me?

34:22.105 --> 34:24.824
Your Majesty, I would never dare.

34:25.344 --> 34:26.784
Then hurry back out and face them.

34:27.545 --> 34:28.465
I…

34:29.824 --> 34:30.865
Well.

34:38.585 --> 34:39.744
So Your Majesty claims illness

34:40.425 --> 34:42.304
only to hide here
in Nanrong Palace for peace and quiet.

34:44.225 --> 34:46.105
Are you saying that I'm not ill?

34:46.744 --> 34:47.905
Your Majesty is ill indeed.

34:48.425 --> 34:50.865
Then Your Majesty must rest
as a sick man should,

34:51.385 --> 34:52.425
and not burden the mind.

34:54.065 --> 34:55.385
Though Your Majesty is here,

34:56.105 --> 34:58.425
the thoughts are still in turmoil.

34:59.665 --> 35:01.025
This does no good
for Your Majesty ailment.

35:01.905 --> 35:04.185
This is a critical time.

35:04.265 --> 35:05.985
I cannot relax for a moment.

35:06.545 --> 35:08.385
I must save
Jiangzhou's soldiers and people.

35:08.465 --> 35:11.425
Yet I cannot abandon
the people of Xuzhou either.

35:12.665 --> 35:15.985
Behind Ling Xuefeng,
stands an entire host of noble clans.

35:16.065 --> 35:17.785
I know this all too well.

35:18.425 --> 35:19.545
If I don't force his hand,

35:20.105 --> 35:22.865
he'll surely abandon Xuzhou
to protect Jiangzhou.

35:23.825 --> 35:26.505
I must take this gamble with him.

35:28.825 --> 35:31.145
His Majesty has feigned illness
and hidden in Nanrong Palace.

35:33.185 --> 35:34.065
I expected it.

35:36.305 --> 35:37.985
Why aren't you peeling the grapes?

35:39.665 --> 35:42.465
These mare-milk grapes must be eaten
with the skin to keep their crispness.

35:43.705 --> 35:45.225
I'll take the rest with me.

35:46.625 --> 35:48.705
You've only just sat down
and already you're leaving.

35:48.785 --> 35:50.585
Didn't I report everything to you earlier?

35:51.185 --> 35:53.545
I strongly opposed
sending troops in court.

35:54.065 --> 35:56.665
His Majesty seemed inclined to agree.

35:56.745 --> 35:59.745
That Ling Xuefeng looked quite distressed.

36:00.985 --> 36:03.265
Ling Jueding holds the military power.

36:04.185 --> 36:07.265
If he loses his standing in this campaign,

36:07.345 --> 36:09.825
Ling Xuefeng will be
as if cut from his right arm.

36:11.185 --> 36:13.185
Naturally His Majesty will be pleased.

36:13.785 --> 36:15.065
So you think

36:15.705 --> 36:18.225
His Majesty would abandon Jiangzhou?

36:21.865 --> 36:23.985
What is it? You don't think so?

36:24.945 --> 36:27.065
Mother, what are you imagining?

36:27.665 --> 36:28.865
If Jiangzhou falls,

36:29.385 --> 36:31.945
who could bear such infamy for all time?

36:32.665 --> 36:35.505
Ling Jueding has guarded Jiangzhou
for years.

36:35.585 --> 36:37.425
There is no one
who knows that land better.

36:38.025 --> 36:41.505
His Majesty would never strip him
of command at such a time.

36:43.025 --> 36:45.505
Then why stage all of this?

36:46.745 --> 36:48.345
The people of Xuzhou are
people all the same.

36:50.025 --> 36:51.105
What did you say?

36:53.385 --> 36:54.465
Nothing.

36:55.265 --> 36:57.745
Mother is wise. I shall take my leave.

37:07.305 --> 37:10.985
The Empress confinement is not yet lifted?

37:11.065 --> 37:11.945
Yes.

37:12.665 --> 37:14.225
With Jiangzhou in peril,

37:14.305 --> 37:16.785
as the elder sister of Young General Ling,

37:17.425 --> 37:19.945
how could she not know?

37:21.785 --> 37:25.225
And if she knew His Majesty refused
to send reinforcements,

37:26.145 --> 37:28.385
what would she think then?

37:38.305 --> 37:39.745
My Lady, Aunt Chan has arrived.

37:57.425 --> 37:59.305
Her Majesty is confined
and copying sutras.

37:59.385 --> 38:00.385
It must drain her spirit.

38:01.265 --> 38:03.185
The Empress Dowager pities her,

38:03.265 --> 38:04.745
so she prepared medicinal dishes

38:04.825 --> 38:05.945
and sent me to deliver them.

38:10.105 --> 38:11.825
Thank the Empress Dowager
for her kindness.

38:13.865 --> 38:15.185
I must continue copying.

38:16.185 --> 38:17.225
Aunt Chan may go.

38:19.905 --> 38:21.385
Perhaps Her Majesty hasn't heard.

38:23.465 --> 38:24.425
Something has happened in Jiangzhou.

38:28.145 --> 38:29.505
What did you say?

38:29.585 --> 38:31.305
NANRONG PALACE

38:31.385 --> 38:33.305
Move aside. I must see His Majesty.

38:34.585 --> 38:37.025
Your Majesty. I know you're inside.

38:38.105 --> 38:40.145
Come out. Your Majesty.

38:41.025 --> 38:42.745
Why will you not send aid to Jiangzhou?

38:43.545 --> 38:44.625
Your Majesty.

38:46.185 --> 38:48.265
-Your Majesty.
-It seems the Empress

38:48.345 --> 38:49.785
already knows of Jiangzhou.

38:51.985 --> 38:54.145
Since Your Majesty has chosen
this political gamble,

38:54.785 --> 38:55.825
you must lay down your stake.

38:56.985 --> 38:57.825
Your Majesty,

38:58.665 --> 39:00.065
you must not soften
because of the Empress.

39:02.225 --> 39:05.705
What lies between me and the Empress
needs no comment from the you.

39:24.985 --> 39:27.025
Did the Grand Tutor
send you to seek me out?

39:28.305 --> 39:29.305
My father?

39:30.905 --> 39:31.865
What has this to do with him?

39:32.465 --> 39:34.305
I came on my own.
It has nothing to do with my father.

39:35.025 --> 39:37.185
My father would never use me as you do.

39:40.785 --> 39:42.865
I was just about to leave the palace.

39:43.705 --> 39:44.905
Come with me.

40:04.105 --> 40:04.945
Come out.

40:25.185 --> 40:26.105
Luo.

40:39.305 --> 40:40.385
You managed to find this place.

40:41.985 --> 40:44.425
I told you that I would never spare you.

40:45.145 --> 40:47.065
-If you want to kill him, kill me first.
-Cangcang.

40:50.945 --> 40:53.985
You are my Empress. Why would I kill you?

41:15.305 --> 41:16.145
Cangcang.

41:19.665 --> 41:21.785
You sought me out today

41:21.865 --> 41:23.545
to urge me to send troops to Jiangzhou

41:23.625 --> 41:25.185
and save your brother, Ling Jueding.

41:25.985 --> 41:28.985
Yet now
you risk your life to protect Luo Xianxue.

41:30.345 --> 41:31.225
Empress,

41:31.745 --> 41:33.225
you certainly care for many people.

41:33.865 --> 41:35.665
I am the only one
you never hold in your heart.

41:35.745 --> 41:39.065
I once held you in mine.
How did you treat me then?

41:46.025 --> 41:47.265
We truly cannot go back.

41:48.305 --> 41:50.745
From the very beginning,
there was only deceit between us.

41:56.505 --> 41:57.425
In that case,

41:58.105 --> 42:00.265
if you kill Luo Xianxue
with your own hand,

42:00.345 --> 42:02.385
I may consider sending aid to Jiangzhou.

42:04.225 --> 42:05.305
You're mad.

42:05.945 --> 42:07.665
If the Empress will not strike,

42:07.745 --> 42:08.665
I can do it for you.

42:37.945 --> 42:39.985
Do you mean to save Luo Xianxue,

42:40.585 --> 42:42.225
or your brother, Ling Jueding?

42:42.305 --> 42:43.625
Xiao Huan!

42:44.145 --> 42:46.545
You are a sovereign.
How can you trifle with lives?

42:46.625 --> 42:49.345
Yet the Empress forces me
to send troops without heed.

42:49.425 --> 42:52.065
Is that not also
treating other lives as trifles?

42:52.705 --> 42:55.145
Jiangzhou and Xuzhou
are both part of my realm.

42:55.225 --> 42:57.425
The Grand Tutor forces me to choose,

42:57.505 --> 42:59.025
so I shall show him

42:59.105 --> 43:00.825
the weight of that choice.
